{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2024-chemistry-11","exam":"MDEET","year":2024,"subject":"chemistry","number":11,"points":3,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","classificationStatus":"editorial-content-based","stem":"그림은 A(g)+B(l)⇄2C(g) 반응의 표준 반응 엔탈피(ΔH°)와\n표준 반응 엔트로피(ΔS°)를 온도 T에 따라 나타낸 것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[3점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 270K의 표준 상태에서 정반응은 발열 반응이다.\nㄴ. 270K에서 C(g) 2몰이 생성될 때의 표준 반응 내부 에너지\n(ΔE°)는 akJ보다 크다.\nㄷ. 반응의 평형 상수는 300K에서가 270K에서보다 크다.","options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":2,"assets":[{"id":"fig-01","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-chemistry-11/01.webp","width":483,"height":310,"region":0,"bbox":[92.33,60.7,161.0,103.33],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[]},{"id":"fig-02","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-chemistry-11/02.webp","width":924,"height":265,"region":0,"bbox":[15.67,239.04,308.0,88.33],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009"]}],"layout":[{"page":5,"sourceRect":[82.0,147.3,413.0,510.18],"width":331.0,"height":362.88,"items":[{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"11. 그림은 A(g)+B(l)⇄2C(g) 반응의 표준 반응 엔탈피(ΔH°)와","bbox":[5.9,10.0,323.08,12.28],"spans":[{"text":"11.","bbox":[5.9,10.0,16.36,12.28],"origin":[5.9,19.02],"size":11.7,"flags":4,"font":"*ÇÑ¾ç°ß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":" 그림은 ","bbox":[22.26,10.75,40.92,11.37],"origin":[22.26,19.02],"size":10.72,"flags":4,"font":"*½Å¸í-Áß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":"A(g)+B(l)","bbox":[64.88,10.51,53.2,11.73],"origin":[64.88,19.32],"size":11.01,"flags":4,"font":"HyhwpEQ"},{"text":"⇄","bbox":[120.26,10.59,11.04,11.01],"origin":[120.26,20.04],"size":11.01,"flags":4,"font":"HaansoftBatang"},{"text":"2C(g)","bbox":[133.52,10.51,28.18,11.73],"origin":[133.52,20.04],"size":11.01,"flags":4,"font":"HyhwpEQ"}